.git
# Environment files, at any depth (a local web/.env.local or api/.env must never reach an
# image layer); the example and the test settings are not secret.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!api/.env.testing
**/node_modules
web/.next
web/playwright-report
web/test-results
api/vendor
api/storage/logs
docs
